{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Lifeward 是一款專為現代人設計的屏幕時間管理工具，幫助你在意圖清晰時設立界限，並在難以停止時堅守規則。這款 App 適合希望減少無意識滑手機、找回工作與生活平衡的用戶，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>提供。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-19.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能設定共用每日限額</h2>\n<p>用戶可選擇易成癮的應用程式或類別，並賦予一個共用的每日使用上限。所有選定應用的耗時均計入同一額度，切換應用不會重置計時器。當達到限制時，App 會透過 Apple Screen Time 暫停存取，提供冷靜提醒而非強制阻擋。若需臨時使用，系統會引入確認步驟以給予反思時間。全程數據本地儲存，無帳號需求，確保隱私安全且讓用戶完全掌控自己的數字習慣。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-14-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Lifeward-Less Screen,More Life</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lifeward-less-screen-more-life/id6806748104?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n",